<BaseLayout title="TB Care at Delek — Delek Hospital" description="Find information about tuberculosis diagnosis, treatment, follow-up and patient support at Delek Hospital.">
<div class="content-wrap"><PageIntro eyebrow="Find Care" title="TB Care at Delek" description="Find information about tuberculosis diagnosis, treatment, follow-up and patient support at Delek Hospital." /><section class="section"><h2>Where to go</h2><p>Contact the hospital for directions to the TB clinic, appointment arrangements and current testing availability.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="tel:+911892222053">Call the hospital</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/find-care/locations">Hospital location</a></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Treatment & follow-up</h2><p>Delek provides TB diagnosis, treatment and follow-up, with dedicated inpatient facilities for patients who require admission. The hospital team can explain the next steps for your individual care.</p></section><section class="section"><h2>Already receiving TB treatment?</h2><p>Please bring available medical records, test results and medication information when you visit.</p></section><aside class="callout"><h2>Cost & patient support</h2><p>If you are concerned about the cost of care, speak with the hospital team about charges and support that may be available.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="/our-impact/tibetan-tb-program">Explore our TB program’s history →</a></div></aside></div>
</BaseLayout>
